NVIDIA NCCL headers
-------------------
Copyright (c) 2017-2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
net-sircl/nccl/ (relative to the repository root) contains unmodified
network-plugin headers from NVIDIA NCCL v2.32.3-1, plugins/net/example/nccl/:
common.h, err.h, gin_v11.h, net.h, net_device.h, net_v2.h through net_v12.h,
and types.h. Their individual notices remain; the Apache-2.0 license text
is in net-sircl/nccl/LICENSE.txt.

No NCCL source is copied into net-sircl/net_sircl.c. NCCL v2.32.3-1 sources
read for behavior, without adaptation: src/transport/net_ib/connect.cc,
p2p.cc, init.cc, reg.cc and gdr.cc; src/transport/net.cc; src/graph/topo.cc;
src/init.cc.

The ACK timeout exponent 20 and transport retry count 7 follow the parameters
IbTimeout and IbRetryCnt in NVIDIA NCCL v2.32.3-1 src/transport/net_ib/connect.cc;
src/include/param.h establishes their NCCL_IB_TIMEOUT and NCCL_IB_RETRY_CNT names.
The plugin's NET_SIRCL_IB_* parsing and diagnostics are independently written.
Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/nccl/tree/v2.32.3-1/src/transport/net_ib

The relayed-channel recommendation follows NVIDIA NCCL v2.32.3-1
src/graph/connect.cc, src/misc/param.cc, src/plugin/tuner.cc and
src/include/plugin/tuner/tuner_v6.h. These were read to establish supported
channel controls, parameter caching and tuner scope. The advisory is
independently written; no upstream implementation was copied.

The ext-net compatibility adapters use the unchanged headers above. NVIDIA NCCL's loaders and
ext-net headers at tags v2.19.1-1 through v2.32.3-1 were read to establish API selection and fallback.
The v2.23.4-1, v2.27.7-1, v2.28.9-1 and v2.32.3-1 build files, src/misc/utils.cc host-hash override,
src/graph/topo.cc physical-NIC fallback, and plugin adapter sources were read for the compatibility
tests. No NVIDIA implementation was copied or adapted into net_sircl_compat.h or the tests.

RoCEnante attribution
---------------------
Includes transport design derived from RoCEnante, the b12x RoCE collectives
from Local Inference Lab (https://github.com/local-inference-lab), licensed
under Apache-2.0. RoCEnante was written by Jason (original-el8) in
local-inference-lab/b12x PR 295, with dual-rail striping and graph-collective
work by Luke Alonso (lukealonso). b12x is developed in FlashInfer at
flashinfer/experimental/b12x.

The plugin's transport design and C route derivation follow the originating
project's collective library. No RoCEnante source file is copied into
net-sircl/net_sircl.c. net-sircl/tests/standin/ includes transport-core's
shared-memory RDMA emulator, used by tests rather than the real-NIC plugin.
